<title>USA: Hayes Wheels International wins VW pact.</title>
<headline>Hayes Wheels International wins VW pact.</headline>
<dateline>ROMULUS, Mich. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hayes Wheels International Inc said Tuesday it received a contract from Volkswagen AG for steel wheels worth more than $4 million.</p>
<p>The wheels are being produced at the company's joint venture in the Czech Republic, Hayes Wheels said.</p>
<p>Hayes Wheels produces and markets steel and aluminum wheels, brake drums and rotors for the automotive and commercial highway markets.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
